      "parameters": {
        "content": "### WF3 — Demand → offer\nPASS = replies ≥ max(25, ceil(views × 1%)).\n\nThe offer on PASS is the **three agent tiers, one Whop product each**:\nCircle **$44** · Pro **$53** · Team **$62**. The one-time ladder ($28 first shot,\n$17 Lite, $35 Good, $89 Better) is a separate door and never gates a tier.\n\n**Nothing is created in Whop by this workflow.** Whop product ids are set once by the\nowner and read by the app from env.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
